ans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a variety of challenges, from classic hidden object scenes to inventive mini-games. Every puzzle brings you closer to the truth while offering fresh ways to test your wits and observation skills.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776790/extras/1352cdb7cf2d4a94ead2a93b11e19835.poster.avif?t=1761667186\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776790/extras/1352cdb7cf2d4a94ead2a93b11e19835.webm?t=1761667186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776790/extras/1352cdb7cf2d4a94ead2a93b11e19835.mp4?t=1761667186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 Explore a vibrant fantasy world: from shadowy corridors to smoky inns and moonlit rooftops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 Search for Hidden Objects and collectible items to unravel the mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 Solve dozens of puzzles, tricky brain teasers, and unique mini-games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 Gather hidden treasures and unlock special achievements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 Untangle royal secrets and treacherous plots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 Enjoy charming artwork, enchanting wallpapers, and a captivating soundtrack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the truth, protect the throne, and save Castelia before it\u2019s too late!</p>","developers":["Do Games Limited"],"dlc":[3777380],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776790/fc251e282c8f6435f516bc8fe4532bc78cadf98f/header.jpg?t=1761667186",